     A*=============================================================
     A*  Subfile for price book items
     A*=============================================================
     A          R SUB01                     SFL
     A*%%TS  SD  20260324  210000  SYSTEM      REL-V7R5M0  5770-WDS
     A                                      SFLNXTCHG
     A            S1OPT          1A  B 10  2
     A            S1ITEM         6A  O 10  5
     A            S1PROD        15A  O 10 13
     A            S1DESC        30A  O 10 29
     A            S1SECT         3A  O 10 61
     A            S1GRP          3A  O 10 66
     A            S1CAT          3A  O 10 71
     A            S1OMIT         6A  O 10 76COLOR(RED)
     A*=============================================================
