     A            #FLD          10A  H
     A            WHERE          5S 0H
     A            COMPANY        3S 0H
     A            BRANCH         3S 0H
     A            CUSTOMER       6S 0H
     A            USERID        10A  H
     A*
     A* Positioning Fields (line 9 - above column headers)
